**At Taskip, we aim to help users get the most out of the platform. Whether you’re a freelancer, a growing team, or an agency, Taskip provides helpful resources and support to make learning the platform easier and more efficient.**

## **Documentation**

**Taskip documentation provides step-by-step guides to help you understand how different features work. You can learn how to set up your workspace, manage projects, track leads, send proposals, create invoices, and configure system settings.**

## **Support & Help Center**

**If you need assistance while using Taskip, you can reach out to the support team. The support system helps users resolve issues, understand features, and get guidance on configuring their workspace effectively.**

## **Tutorials and Guides**

**Taskip provides tutorials and feature guides through [Blogs](https://taskip.net/blog/) and a [YouTube channel](https://www.youtube.com/@taskipapp) that explain how to use different modules, such as project management, client portals, quotations, invoicing, and workflow automation.**

## **Community & Feedback**

**Taskip users can share feedback, ask questions, and learn from others using the platform. Community discussions help users discover new ways to manage their workflows and grow their business using Taskip.**

## **Product Updates**

**Taskip regularly introduces new features and improvements. Following product updates helps users stay informed about new tools, improvements, and best practices for using the platform.**
